# Secrets for `act` (copy to .secrets, gitignored, never commit it).
# The workflows only need GITHUB_TOKEN to publish images, and local runs never
# publish, so this can stay empty. Add a token only to test GHCR login locally:
# GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_...
# Optional: a confirmed Supabase user for the signed-in Playwright test
# (the event-store migration must be applied to that project).
# E2E_EMAIL=
# E2E_PASSWORD=
